WEBVTT

00:07.903 --> 00:13.663
Let's laugh and cry.
chanto waraimasho, nakimasho

00:14.163 --> 00:19.753
Subs originally by Froth-Bite
Manually retyped by #Retrofit@IRC.Rizon.Net
Raws by Darkside-Raws
We need to fill up our hearts.
kokoro no nakami wo juujitsu sasenakuccha

00:19.793 --> 00:28.343
Making matching memories with you...
anata to osoroi no omoide tsukuruno ga

00:28.343 --> 00:30.213
...is important.
daiji daiji

00:31.593 --> 00:34.143
Sometimes I become...
sunao ni narenakattari

00:34.473 --> 00:37.973
...almost dishonest and mean
ijiwaru shichaisouna hi aruno

00:39.473 --> 00:40.813
That's because...
sore wa...

00:42.813 --> 00:45.563
I love you and adore you,
daisuki de taisetsu de

00:45.693 --> 00:48.903
and I don't want to be apart from you.
hanaretaku nai sei nano nante

00:50.863 --> 00:51.863
That's the truth.
henne

00:54.413 --> 01:01.123
I just want to cuddle...
hontou wa itsumo nuku nuku shitetai

01:01.453 --> 01:03.463
...with you.
futaride

01:04.463 --> 01:10.173
So let's laugh and cry.
dakara waraimashou, nakimashou

01:10.843 --> 01:16.263
We need to keep our hearts warm.
kokoro no ondo wo atatame awanakucha

01:16.473 --> 01:24.773
The fate that made us meet...
anata to deaeta unmei ho subetega

01:24.773 --> 01:26.603
...is important.
daiji daiji

01:38.693 --> 01:40.403
I'm done, Kozue-chan.

01:40.683 --> 01:42.723
What are you calling me Kozue for?

01:44.603 --> 01:45.663
Sorry!

01:46.143 --> 01:47.813
I'm done, Saki-chan!

01:48.893 --> 01:51.363
I'm not Saki... Maybe...

01:53.113 --> 01:55.033
Onii-chan, you're good at drawing!

01:55.033 --> 01:58.283
Yeah, I say your drawings are good too.

01:58.283 --> 01:59.863
You think so?

02:00.783 --> 02:01.953
Shiratori-san,

02:02.663 --> 02:04.293
we're all here now.

02:04.293 --> 02:06.753
As if I would be a model for a man!

02:06.753 --> 02:09.633
Oh, come on! We are all doing it.

02:09.633 --> 02:12.213
Onii-chan! Draw me soon!

02:12.213 --> 02:15.173
I'm looking forward to you finishing it... maybe.

02:18.093 --> 02:19.183
Impossible...

02:19.803 --> 02:22.933
This is simply... impossible...

02:23.303 --> 02:23.803
Kozue Onee-chan!

02:23.803 --> 02:25.473
Impossible...
Kozue Onee-chan!

02:26.973 --> 02:29.273
That's impossible!

02:33.693 --> 02:35.273
Oh, it was a dream.

02:35.783 --> 02:39.783
Thank god it was a dream... or not...

02:43.993 --> 02:48.773
Meow Meow Meow

02:56.133 --> 02:57.843
Good morning, Kozue-chan.

02:57.843 --> 02:59.343
Good morning.

02:59.343 --> 03:00.423
Are you going out?

03:00.803 --> 03:01.513
Yeah.

03:01.513 --> 03:03.183
It's going to get cold soon,

03:03.843 --> 03:07.013
so I thought I'd go get winter clothes.

03:07.683 --> 03:09.643
Since it's a beautiful Sunday.

03:10.183 --> 03:13.063
The heck with Sunday!

03:13.903 --> 03:14.653
Tama!

03:16.023 --> 03:18.823
It's Sunday every day for you.

03:18.823 --> 03:19.903
Tamami-chan...

03:19.903 --> 03:21.453
Be quiet!

03:21.453 --> 03:24.323
What are you doing up so early?

03:24.323 --> 03:25.573
For this.

03:26.123 --> 03:29.293
I'm going to find parts for my digital camera.

03:29.913 --> 03:32.543
Upgrading again?

03:32.543 --> 03:36.343
Would you please delete any weird photos of me?

03:36.343 --> 03:38.553
Weird photos?

03:38.963 --> 03:40.843
Like this?

03:41.883 --> 03:43.843
I have more.

03:44.803 --> 03:46.433
My, my...

03:48.103 --> 03:49.183
Look at this face!

03:49.933 --> 03:51.563
Oh, the best shot!

03:52.773 --> 03:53.853
Kozue-chan.

03:55.103 --> 03:56.443
She's so lovely!

03:57.193 --> 04:00.943
Kozue-chan holding a broom is lovely too.

04:00.943 --> 04:05.533
I'll upgrade this, and take even more lovely photos of Kozue-chan.

04:05.533 --> 04:06.783
Yeah, yeah.

04:06.783 --> 04:09.973
So, I'm going out too.

04:10.013 --> 04:10.703
Sure.

04:10.833 --> 04:12.833
Then, let's go out together, Tama-san.

04:13.333 --> 04:19.133
I don't mind, but I won't pay for any of the stuff you buy.

04:19.133 --> 04:20.553
I didn't ask you to.

04:21.093 --> 04:25.593
Then, we'll finish our shopping quickly, and be back soon.

04:25.593 --> 04:26.893
See you later.

04:26.893 --> 04:28.353
Take care.

04:31.063 --> 04:32.433
Hey, Kozue.

04:32.433 --> 04:34.733
Oh, Haibara-san.

04:34.733 --> 04:36.063
We're going out for a bit.

04:36.483 --> 04:38.773
Have a good day.

04:40.903 --> 04:42.363
Oh, Kozue.

04:42.363 --> 04:43.153
Yes?

04:43.153 --> 04:44.653
What do you think of him dressed up?

04:44.653 --> 04:45.863
Does he look good?

04:45.863 --> 04:46.953
Yes?

04:46.953 --> 04:49.033
He's wearing his Sunday clothes.

04:49.033 --> 04:50.243
What do you think?

04:50.743 --> 04:53.163
Yes, you look very nice.

04:53.623 --> 04:54.833
Oh, yeah?

04:54.833 --> 04:57.713
I can trust that, coming from you.

04:57.713 --> 04:59.383
Then, we're off.

04:59.713 --> 05:01.133
Have a nice day.

05:04.883 --> 05:06.223
Mom!

05:06.223 --> 05:09.303
Hurry! Hurry! Right now!

05:09.303 --> 05:11.313
Are you going out too?

05:12.013 --> 05:12.813
Yeah.

05:12.813 --> 05:15.893
There is a big sale at the supermarket two train stations away.

05:15.893 --> 05:16.233
I see.

05:16.773 --> 05:20.483
There are a lot of things marked as one item per customer,

05:20.483 --> 05:22.573
so I'm going with Mom.

05:23.573 --> 05:25.533
Mom! Come on!

05:25.533 --> 05:28.163
I'll stay home.

05:28.163 --> 05:29.493
Don't say that!

05:29.493 --> 05:31.283
Come on, get a hold of yourself.

05:31.283 --> 05:35.373
We can have a big dinner if we work hard today.

05:36.003 --> 05:38.583
Dinner... Big dinner...

05:38.583 --> 05:39.673
That's right!

05:39.673 --> 05:40.883
So, let's go!

05:43.053 --> 05:44.093
Then I'll go.

05:44.763 --> 05:47.053
So we're off, Kozue Onee-chan.

05:47.053 --> 05:50.473
We're walking, so we should be back this evening.

05:50.473 --> 05:53.013
Walking? Two train stations' distance?

05:53.013 --> 05:53.603
Yeah!

05:54.063 --> 05:56.143
We're off!

05:58.063 --> 05:59.943
So, I'm holding down the fort.

06:01.313 --> 06:03.323
I'll clean a lot!

06:12.073 --> 06:12.493
1, 2,

06:12.573 --> 06:13.123
1, 2,

06:13.203 --> 06:13.663
1, 2,

06:13.783 --> 06:14.453
1, 2,...

06:17.203 --> 06:19.213
There...

06:36.473 --> 06:37.773
So cute!

06:41.273 --> 06:43.483
You have a pretty collar.

06:45.523 --> 06:47.153
Whose kitty are you?

06:47.783 --> 06:49.193
Where did you come from?

06:50.453 --> 06:52.243
Did you get lost?

06:52.873 --> 06:54.073
Well, you are a cat.

06:54.073 --> 06:55.493
You can't talk.

07:03.923 --> 07:06.713
Oh? Is he his brother?

07:07.463 --> 07:08.383
Come here.

07:11.053 --> 07:13.263
Don't do that!

07:35.663 --> 07:38.083
Heeeeey!

07:45.173 --> 07:46.713
Yes.

07:47.213 --> 07:48.753
What is it?

07:49.423 --> 07:50.343
Cats?

07:51.093 --> 07:54.383
Are you the one who's keeping the cats!?

07:54.383 --> 07:55.763
Huh? The cats?

07:55.763 --> 08:00.523
Who said you could have pets without asking me!?

08:01.143 --> 08:03.233
Um, are you Saki-chan?

08:04.143 --> 08:07.403
Don't play dumb with me, Shiratori!

08:13.363 --> 08:15.823
This is the best.

08:23.713 --> 08:26.673
I understand that they're stray cats.

08:26.673 --> 08:28.253
It was my mistake.

08:29.543 --> 08:31.593
Sorry, Shiratori.

08:32.053 --> 08:34.093
It's okay.

08:34.973 --> 08:36.513
Well, it's a thing of the past.

08:36.513 --> 08:37.393
Don't mind it.

08:38.473 --> 08:39.853
You're right.

08:39.853 --> 08:42.103
So, about them.

08:42.603 --> 08:45.523
Do we need to keep them until we find their owner?

08:45.523 --> 08:48.523
Oh, I don't hate cats, so it'll be fine.

08:49.983 --> 08:52.073
You're such a simpleton.

08:52.943 --> 08:54.493
They're living creatures.

08:54.493 --> 08:57.493
Keeping them comes with certain responsibilities.

08:57.493 --> 08:59.323
Drink up!

09:00.373 --> 09:02.663
If they drink something bad and get sick, or...

09:12.713 --> 09:15.763
It could be bad for them.

09:15.763 --> 09:17.973
They're alive too.

09:18.263 --> 09:20.763
So we need to take good care of them.

09:21.473 --> 09:22.603
You're right.

09:22.603 --> 09:23.773
See?

09:23.773 --> 09:26.103
You are kind-hearted after all.

09:27.023 --> 09:29.103
What, all of a sudden!?

09:29.103 --> 09:32.153
I just said what's necessary.

09:32.153 --> 09:32.653
OK?

09:34.363 --> 09:38.993
A-Anyway, something for them to eat...

09:44.243 --> 09:45.203
HEY!

09:48.623 --> 09:51.503
You guys! Don't walk on the table!

09:52.003 --> 09:55.303
It's where we eat our meals.

09:55.303 --> 09:56.883
You got it?!

09:58.553 --> 10:01.643
You don't get it, do you?

10:01.643 --> 10:07.183
We're taking care of you from now on, so learn the rules!

10:09.313 --> 10:10.733
You got it?

10:10.733 --> 10:13.153
Don't get on the table again.

10:13.153 --> 10:16.033
Saki-chan, preaching to the cats wouldn't be any...

10:16.033 --> 10:19.453
Better to tell them the rules up front!

10:19.453 --> 10:21.283
Yes, sorry.

10:33.083 --> 10:35.673
Shiratori, go catch that cat!

10:35.673 --> 10:36.673
Okay!

10:39.343 --> 10:41.263
You can't get away.

10:45.183 --> 10:45.763
Damn...

11:02.363 --> 11:03.913
Are you looking for something?

11:03.913 --> 11:07.583
Yeah, you know, the cat that ran away with your bell.

11:07.583 --> 11:08.913
Really?

11:11.923 --> 11:13.423
Kozue-chan?

11:13.423 --> 11:14.083
Yes.

11:14.423 --> 11:15.463
<i>I see.</i>

11:15.463 --> 11:18.003
<i>Saki-chan turned back into Kozue-chan.</i>

11:19.963 --> 11:22.263
I'm looking for the kitties.

11:22.263 --> 11:23.843
I see.

11:23.843 --> 11:25.103
Then, I'll help too.

11:25.643 --> 11:27.603
Then, I'll go look outside.

11:27.603 --> 11:30.393
Then, I'll stay in the courtyard.

11:30.893 --> 11:34.483
Kitties, where are you?

11:36.153 --> 11:38.653
Oh, there you are.

11:40.443 --> 11:42.323
My, there's another one!

11:42.993 --> 11:44.573
Where did you come from?

11:45.203 --> 11:46.993
Do you have something for me?

12:10.483 --> 12:12.483
They're not around.

12:12.483 --> 12:14.813
Where did you run off to?

12:15.773 --> 12:16.943
Wow!

12:16.943 --> 12:17.813
The three guys in the forest screamed.

12:17.813 --> 12:19.323
Hey, that voice...
The three guys in the forest screamed.

12:19.323 --> 12:19.943
The three guys in the forest screamed.

12:19.943 --> 12:24.533
The cat-witch told them:

12:25.323 --> 12:27.823
"Listen carefully."

12:27.823 --> 12:30.913
"Plant this seed on the night...

12:30.913 --> 12:35.293
...of the new moon," he said.

12:36.043 --> 12:37.963
As I thought, it's Nanako-chan.

12:38.423 --> 12:40.633
And there's another cat too.

12:45.053 --> 12:46.933
Onii-chan!

12:46.933 --> 12:48.933
Hello, Nanako-chan.

12:49.643 --> 12:52.183
Onii-chan!

12:53.063 --> 12:54.683
Yayayayayay!

12:54.683 --> 12:56.693
I'm so happy!

12:58.863 --> 13:00.693
Hey, listen, listen.

13:01.153 --> 13:06.113
I was reading a story to the kitties!

13:06.113 --> 13:08.073
Am I good?

13:08.363 --> 13:10.123
Y-Yes, you are.

13:10.123 --> 13:11.453
See?

13:17.373 --> 13:20.383
Onii-chan came here too, so let's play together.

13:23.763 --> 13:25.093
Here you go.

13:25.513 --> 13:27.133
Eat a lot.

13:27.133 --> 13:28.223
Sure...

13:29.053 --> 13:33.103
I didn't think I'd be playing house at this age...

13:33.313 --> 13:35.353
Daddy, is it yummy?

13:36.393 --> 13:37.353
Daddy?

13:37.353 --> 13:38.483
Me?

13:38.483 --> 13:39.353
Yeah!

13:39.353 --> 13:40.653
I'm the mommy.

13:40.653 --> 13:45.233
And they are our cute, cute kids.

13:45.993 --> 13:48.113
Family Time

13:49.283 --> 13:53.333
So the situation is that we are married?

13:53.333 --> 13:54.543
Situation?

13:55.413 --> 13:59.833
Don't use such a word.

13:59.833 --> 14:01.833
The kids are listening.

14:01.833 --> 14:04.003
Oh, sorry.

14:04.553 --> 14:07.223
Daddy, would you like seconds?

14:07.223 --> 14:09.343
Oh, I'm full.

14:09.343 --> 14:12.473
Then thank you for the food.

14:12.473 --> 14:14.103
Thank you for the food.

14:14.643 --> 14:16.853
Then let's get to bed.

14:16.853 --> 14:18.103
Yeah.

14:32.203 --> 14:33.323
What should I do?

14:34.493 --> 14:35.873
What's going to happen?

14:40.043 --> 14:41.673
Shiratori-san.

14:41.753 --> 14:42.753
Shiratori-san.

14:43.673 --> 14:45.093
Are you okay?

14:45.093 --> 14:46.303
Shiratori-san.

14:47.883 --> 14:50.303
I'm sleepy.

14:50.303 --> 14:54.183
You'll catch a cold if you take a nap here.

14:57.063 --> 14:58.983
Kozue-chan?

14:59.563 --> 15:01.103
That's right.

15:01.813 --> 15:06.403
You looked so comfortable napping, so I wandered if I should wake you up.

15:06.403 --> 15:08.403
But I was worried.

15:08.403 --> 15:11.363
Oh, it just felt so good here.

15:11.363 --> 15:12.783
Oh, the kiddies.

15:14.123 --> 15:16.493
You were looking for them, right?

15:17.913 --> 15:18.793
Yeah.

15:18.793 --> 15:21.913
But we're looking for their owner too.

15:22.623 --> 15:25.333
Look, they all have collars.

15:25.333 --> 15:26.543
Really.

15:27.213 --> 15:30.343
Then we'd better make a poster for them.

15:30.343 --> 15:31.803
That's a good idea!

15:31.803 --> 15:35.553
I'll go feed them some milk while you do that.

15:35.553 --> 15:36.433
OK.

15:36.433 --> 15:40.523
Okay, everyone, let's go drink some yummy milk.

15:41.143 --> 15:42.693
Come follow me.

15:45.193 --> 15:47.363
OK, off to the poster!

15:50.033 --> 15:51.693
Here's the milk.

15:52.573 --> 15:54.033
Here you go.

15:57.533 --> 15:58.743
Is it yummy?

15:58.743 --> 16:00.913
Drink plenty.

16:14.183 --> 16:14.633
Good!

16:14.633 --> 16:15.133
Narutakisou
Collar
We have lost kitties
Good!

16:15.133 --> 16:16.843
This should do.
We have lost kitties
Collar
Narutakisou

16:16.843 --> 16:17.833
We have lost kitties
Collar
Narutakisou

16:26.853 --> 16:28.063
Correct!

16:28.063 --> 16:33.243
In today's society, even kitties must be dressed properly.

16:34.903 --> 16:36.363
You understand it too?

16:36.363 --> 16:38.493
Ch-Chiyuri-chan.

16:38.493 --> 16:40.833
And there's another kitty too.

16:41.413 --> 16:44.583
Oh, but I see it's a little off.

16:44.583 --> 16:47.543
I must correct your clothes!

16:47.543 --> 16:50.053
I must check the other kitties too.

16:50.123 --> 16:50.493
Here.

16:50.543 --> 16:51.803
Let me see.

16:52.463 --> 16:54.303
Oh, just as I thought!

16:54.303 --> 16:57.183
How could I allow myself to make such mistakes!

16:57.183 --> 16:58.223
You think so?

16:58.223 --> 17:00.103
I think they're really cute.

17:00.103 --> 17:02.603
You don't understand a single bit.

17:02.603 --> 17:04.853
Listen, the proper attire is...

17:07.653 --> 17:10.273
You are... Shiratori Ryushi!

17:10.273 --> 17:17.323
You have a feminine face but... a man! A man! A man!

17:19.413 --> 17:21.373
Are you okay, Chiyuri-chan?

17:21.533 --> 17:22.333
But if I leave her like that...

17:22.333 --> 17:23.663
But if I leave her like that...
But if I leave her like that...

17:23.663 --> 17:23.743
But if I leave her like that...

17:24.293 --> 17:25.623
Are you okay, Chiyuri-chan?

17:25.623 --> 17:26.333
Chiyuri-chan!

17:26.753 --> 17:27.963
Chiyuri-chan!

17:29.753 --> 17:31.503
He has a feminine face but

17:31.503 --> 17:32.803
A MAN
He has a feminine face but

17:33.423 --> 17:35.263
A man!

17:35.263 --> 17:36.633
That's how it'll end up...

17:36.633 --> 17:37.013
This is the last thing I would want.
That's how it'll end up...

17:37.013 --> 17:39.433
This is the last thing I would want.

17:44.353 --> 17:46.023
I'm Ryuko.

17:47.393 --> 17:49.063
Chiyuri-chan!

17:51.733 --> 17:52.983
Oh, are you okay?

17:52.983 --> 17:54.483
Did you hurt anything?

17:59.823 --> 18:04.873
Um, could you be... Konno Natsume-chan?

18:05.243 --> 18:07.503
That's shameful... maybe.

18:08.713 --> 18:10.083
Oh, this?

18:10.083 --> 18:11.333
That's nothing!

18:13.253 --> 18:16.593
I'll forget all about it... maybe.

18:16.593 --> 18:17.883
Thank you.

18:19.933 --> 18:22.473
Is that your magic trick?

18:22.473 --> 18:24.263
No... maybe.

18:25.353 --> 18:26.723
The fifth kitty!?

18:28.983 --> 18:33.983
Here at Narutakisou.
We have lost kitties.

18:56.593 --> 18:58.513
That's great!

19:00.343 --> 19:02.093
We're home!

19:05.353 --> 19:07.433
Man, that was heavy.

19:07.433 --> 19:12.523
The walk home from the station never felt this long before.

19:12.523 --> 19:17.573
Our luck ended when we ran into the Kurosaki family.

19:17.573 --> 19:18.653
I'm sorry.

19:18.653 --> 19:20.903
Mom said she couldn't move anymore.

19:25.743 --> 19:27.033
Get off of me now!

19:27.033 --> 19:28.913
Get off!

19:28.913 --> 19:30.913
Mom!

19:30.913 --> 19:33.503
Asami-chan, the rest is up to you.

19:33.503 --> 19:36.173
Yeah, thanks for the help!

19:36.923 --> 19:39.883
Man, that was tiring.

19:39.883 --> 19:42.763
A cold beer will feel good!

19:43.433 --> 19:44.683
What?

19:47.433 --> 19:48.973
What are they doing?

19:49.773 --> 19:52.233
Is that Natsume-chan?

19:52.233 --> 19:55.023
And what's up with the pack of cats?

19:55.353 --> 19:57.193
Hey, Shiratori-kun!

19:57.193 --> 19:59.823
Oh, Momono-san, and Tamami-chan.

19:59.823 --> 20:00.693
Welcome home.

20:00.693 --> 20:02.323
Save the greetings!

20:02.323 --> 20:04.243
What in the world happened?

20:04.243 --> 20:07.123
That's my question exactly.

20:07.123 --> 20:09.623
Each time there's another cat, Kozue-chan...

20:09.623 --> 20:11.003
I mean, Saki-chan...

20:11.003 --> 20:12.753
I mean, Nanako-chan...

20:12.753 --> 20:13.913
Chiyuri-chan...

20:13.913 --> 20:15.333
Natsume-chan came...

20:15.333 --> 20:17.253
In other words, you went through a lot.

20:17.503 --> 20:18.963
That's right.

20:18.963 --> 20:22.213
I'd like to hear the details.

20:23.223 --> 20:26.593
Was there anything you can't talk about!?

20:41.483 --> 20:42.363
My...

20:48.283 --> 20:50.283
My hair band...

20:50.283 --> 20:52.493
When did it come off?

20:53.543 --> 20:55.213
You found it for me?

20:55.213 --> 20:55.753
Thank you.

20:58.753 --> 21:02.343
But were there five kitties?

21:02.343 --> 21:05.013
The kitties are in the courtyard.

21:05.013 --> 21:05.923
Come this way.

21:07.893 --> 21:10.763
We found the kitties' owner.

21:11.933 --> 21:14.893
Thank you so much.

21:14.893 --> 21:15.893
No problem.

21:16.563 --> 21:18.733
I'm glad you found your way home.

21:18.733 --> 21:20.563
Don't get lost again.

21:24.323 --> 21:26.153
Good bye, kitties.

21:29.573 --> 21:33.293
Shiratori-kun, sounds like you had a big day.

21:33.913 --> 21:36.083
Not really.

21:42.343 --> 21:45.263
In a sense, it was a fun day.

21:55.393 --> 22:01.903
One day, I drew a picture all over a canvas,
itsu no hika canvas ni e ippai

22:01.983 --> 22:07.703
a picture of 7-colored dreams.
nanairo no yume egaita

22:09.123 --> 22:15.583
When I noticed, I was a bit more grown up.
ki ga tsukeba sukoshi otona ni natte

22:15.833 --> 22:20.883
What have I found?
nani wo mitsuketandarou

22:22.843 --> 22:29.593
In this aimless daily life,
yuka ate no nai mainichi no nakade

22:29.843 --> 22:35.523
I found something that's most important.
ichiban taisetsuna koto ni kizuita

22:36.523 --> 22:42.363
Yes, it's always all right,
donna tokidemo sousa daijoubu

22:42.363 --> 22:44.613
because you are here.
kimi ga irukara

22:44.823 --> 22:50.993
Holding these unforgettable thoughts,
wasurenai kono omoi dakishimete

22:51.493 --> 22:57.333
I will start walking the path of the halted fantasy again,
mouichido togireta yume no fantasy

22:57.333 --> 23:01.963
at my own speed.
aruitemiyou boku no speed de

23:17.973 --> 23:18.273
The Next Episode Preview Corner

23:18.273 --> 23:20.733
We had so few lines in this episode.
The Next Episode Preview Corner

23:20.733 --> 23:23.193
I'm happy I got to see many sides of Kozue-chan!
The Next Episode Preview Corner

23:23.193 --> 23:25.613
How could she be alone with Shiratori-san, though!?
The Next Episode Preview Corner

23:25.613 --> 23:28.233
I'm still unhappy! Damn!
The Next Episode Preview Corner

23:28.233 --> 23:28.613
Everyone's Day
I'm still unhappy! Damn!

23:28.613 --> 23:30.363
Next Mahoraba - Everyone's Day
Everyone's Day

23:30.363 --> 23:32.993
I want to be alone with Kozue-chan!
Everyone's Day
